Jeff Kohler, course-material author, Penn State College of Earth and Mineral Sciences; the consulted course entrance names instructor Sekhar Bhattacharyya. MNG 230, Introduction to Mining Engineering. [Official open course](https://courses.ems.psu.edu/mng230/node/2) · [Complete public reading sequence](https://courses.ems.psu.edu/mng230/book/export/html/2).

Read the whole course and its worked material as the first substantial mining progression, from commodities and deposits through evaluation, methods, unit operations, equipment, lifecycle, and wider context. A course description is distinguished from public access to every campus assessment or external reading.

